  "body": "This is a rare opportunity to secure your beautiful coastal home before the build begins.\r\n\r\nSet in an elevated position with sweeping sea views, this two-storey residence by award-winning Madison Park Homes delivers modern coastal living with a refined Abodo timber and Sto plaster exterior, louvre feature detailing, and considered architectural design throughout.\r\n\r\nThe building consent has been lodged, creating a short window for early purchasers to secure the home at an adaptable specification level.\r\n\r\n***** By Negotiation\r\n\r\nEarly buyers can work with the builder to tailor the internal finishes to suit budget and requirements. Once construction begins, all selections will be locked in and pricing will reflect the chosen specification level.\r\n\r\nKey Features (Higher Specification Design)\r\n10-Year Master Build Guarantee\r\nCustom-designed kitchen & Scullery\r\nCustom Wine Cellar\r\nCustom ensuite / wet room\r\nMaster walk-in wardrobe & Dressing area\r\nSeparate media room\r\n2 x Separate Powder rooms\r\n2 bathrooms (1 x ensuite)\r\nDucted Heating\r\nFIreplace\r\nTimber Herringbone flooring \r\nArchitectural design with sea views\r\n\r\n*Images are 3D renders showing the higher specification design intent and finishes.\r\n\r\nEnquire Now\r\nThis is a rare opportunity to secure a brand-new architectural home in a premium coastal setting.\r\n Contact us early to discuss specification options and secure this coastal architectural home before construction progresses.\r\n\r\n Flexibility is still available, but only for a limited time.",
